stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Issued : invoice generated
    Issued --> PartiallyPaid : partial payment applied
    Issued --> Paid : full payment applied
    Issued --> Overdue : due date passes
    PartiallyPaid --> Paid : remaining balance settled
    PartiallyPaid --> Overdue : due date passes
    Overdue --> PartiallyPaid : partial recovery
    Overdue --> Paid : full recovery
    Overdue --> HoldApplied : financial hold enforced
    HoldApplied --> Paid : invoice settled
    Paid --> [*]
